"""Test channel for the 98ed74c1-19ac-5ec8-adaf-392a172d4600.

The shipped extract's expected reports come from an independent forward reference run on the
embedded copy of the shipped data. Twenty held-out extracts in the shipped layout are generated
here from fixed seeds; the delivered program runs on each one as an unprivileged user, under an
audit hook, with a 60 second limit per call measured from this process, and each extract passes
only when all nine reports match the reference byte for byte. The reference for a held-out extract
uses the clock offsets the generator placed, not a recovery.

Negative checks return True when the bad act happened; the negative weight does the punishing.
"""
